WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.710
- So, apparently something
really interesting

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:04.340
happened on Newsmax the
other day. Let's watch.

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:06.250
- Well, first mine was taken down

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:08.270
because we have all the election fraud

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:09.580
with these Dominion machines.

00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:11.380
We have 100% proof.

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:12.213
- All right, so right off the bat,

00:00:12.213 --> 00:00:13.640
you have Mike Lindell spouting off

00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:15.970
some crazy conspiracy
theories about the election,

00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:17.770
which have obviously been disproven.

00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:18.603
- It was (indistinct)

00:00:18.603 --> 00:00:21.260
- [Male Anchor] Mike. Thank
you very much. Mike, Mike.

00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:23.348
You're talking about machines

00:00:23.348 --> 00:00:26.400
that we at Newsmax have
not been able to verify,

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:28.210
- Hilarious. Newsmax then cuts him off,

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:30.490
because he's spouting some crazy nonsense.

00:00:30.490 --> 00:00:32.490
- We just want to let people know

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:34.070
that there is there is nothing substantive

00:00:34.070 --> 00:00:36.550
that we've seen. Let me
read you something here

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:37.540
- So as you probably know,

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:40.220
Newsmax got a Cease and Desist
Letter demanding a retraction

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:41.770
from Smartmatic and Dominion saying

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:43.230
that all this is crazy nonsense.

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:44.910
So, that's what they're reacting to here.

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:48.230
- While there were some
clear evidence of some cases

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:50.320
of vote fraud and election irregularities,

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:53.370
the election results in
every state were certified

00:00:53.370 --> 00:00:55.570
- [Vlogger] Finally, Mike
Lindell stops talking

